    text: "B and G lines: bus shuttles will provide service between Union Station and 41st-Fox Station beginning with the 4:11 a.m. departure from 41st-Fox Station and lasting until approximately 1 p.m. Customers can board bus shuttles at the following station locations: \r\n\n•\tUnion Station – Gate B-22 \r\n•\t41st-Fox Station – Gate D  \r\n\n\r\n\nAffected stops:\r\n41st / Fox Station\r\nUnion Station"
